{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12977","headline":"暮春於山谷寺上方遇恩命加官赐服詶皇甫侍御见贺之作 · 独孤及","name":"暮春於山谷寺上方遇恩命加官赐服詶皇甫侍御见贺之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天书到法堂，朽质被荣光。\n自笑无功德，殊恩谬激扬。\n还登建礼署，犹忝会稽章。\n佳句慙相及，称仁岂易当。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12977.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12977","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}